  googlePolicyLabel: 'Google privacy policy',
  transfersTitle: 'Processing abroad', transfers: 'Infomaniak hosts in Switzerland. Plausible hosts audience data in Germany. Supabase operates the configured project infrastructure in the European Union and may provide support from the United States. Resend and Cal.com operate from the United States. Cloudflare, Google and Stripe use global infrastructure and may process data in Switzerland, the European Economic Area, the United States and the other countries listed in their privacy and subprocessor documentation. Transfers rely, as applicable, on a Swiss adequacy decision, the Swiss–U.S. Data Privacy Framework for certified recipients, or recognised standard contractual clauses and supplementary safeguards.',
